{"4515420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Curtain Call", "steam_appid": 4515420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An invitation from a friend to audition in a theatre play goes awry when he ends up missing. As you explore, the mystery behind his disappearance deepens - and so do the dangers behind it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515420/extras/c03dd30100a8bed3524de7ecd85ca3f6.poster.avif?t=1780590370\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515420/extras/c03dd30100a8bed3524de7ecd85ca3f6.webm?t=1780590370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515420/extras/c03dd30100a8bed3524de7ecd85ca3f6.mp4?t=1780590370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curtain Call is a first-person survival-horror game set in a late 19th century Victorian theater. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the corruptive backrooms of the Theatre while finding scarce, but essential resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off various grisly creatures using your special time-based ability and your arsenal of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve strenuous challenges to unveil what's happening behind the Curtain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515420/extras/60318d41764b0024e8e28a024e2d3c76.poster.avif?t=1780590370\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets